1. Sidebar Navigation
Requirements
Fixed-position sidebar with the following navigation items:
Dashboard
Courses
Practice
Community
Profile
Settings
Each item includes a meaningful, consistent icon
Active state clearly indicated (highlighted background, accent color, or left border indicator)
Hover animations (subtle background shift, icon scale, or color transition)
Smooth page transitions between sections
Collapsible sidebar for smaller screens (icon-only mode)
Keyboard accessibility (Tab navigation, Enter to activate)
Suggestions & Enhancements
Add a "Favorites" or "Pinned" section where users can pin frequently accessed pages
Include a "Recent" dropdown showing the last 3–5 visited sections
Add a progress indicator next to "Courses" showing enrolled course count
Implement a notification badge on "Community" (unread messages, replies)
Add a "Help" or "Support" item at the bottom of the sidebar
Include a "Logout" option at the very bottom
Support drag-and-drop reordering of sidebar items (customizable navigation)
Add a tooltip on hover when sidebar is collapsed


